  "card": "Removes references to the MAX_BIP125_RBF_SEQUENCE constant from functional tests and the shared test framework, switching to MAX_SEQUENCE_NONFINAL or default values. This refactor aligns test suite conventions with the broader deprecation and eventual removal of BIP 125 opt-in RBF signaling across Bitcoin Core (partially addressing #32661). It depends on #35433, which deprecates the replaceable RPC arguments, and bundles those commits while in draft.",
